  m_Name: Note_PotatoSoupCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GrandmasHouse::GrandmasHouse.Data.NoteData
  kind: 1
  title: Potato Soup
  recipe: {fileID: 0}
  body: '(stand-in until Grandma''s own card is added)


    Potato Soup


    4
    or 5 potatoes, sliced

    1 onion, sliced

    A carrot if you have one

    Water
    to cover, and a scoop of salt


    Scrape it all into the pot, fill it with
    water at the sink, and let it boil till the potatoes fall apart on a fork. Ladle
    it into bowls. Feeds four on a cold night.'
  marginNote: Thicker than you think. It holds you longer than any of it would raw.
